{"text":"延昌元年歲次壬辰，十一月丁亥朔四日，清信士弟子劉洛真兄弟爲亡父母敬造彌勒像二區，使亡父母託生紫微安樂之處。又願七世父母、師僧、眷屬、見在居門，老者延年，少者益算，便法解□□□□□□□。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉洛","refId":null,"text":"劉洛","start":23,"end":25},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":34,"end":36},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":44,"end":46},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"紫微","refId":null,"text":"紫微","start":46,"end":48},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"安樂","refId":null,"text":"安樂","start":48,"end":50}]}